fixture oneway_lip_crouch_slide_down
doc run right on the 4 u lip lying on the one-way and crouch just before its end: the crouched box slides (decelerating over 4 f) off the lip and steps down onto the one-way, still crouched and on the ground.
room test/oneway_lip
spawn 380 316
frames 30
input
  0..9 R
  10..29 D
end
expect
  never 0..29 state=air
  at 29 crouch=1 y=320u
end
